# GeT-RM reference material, Coriell ID GM16689. GeT-RM consensus diplotype:
# *2/*2 (tested with 3 methods: Roche AmpliChip, AutoGenomics INFINITI,
# Luminex xTAG; none of these 3 test the *17 promoter variant, but since
# both chromosomes are already accounted for by *2, there is no room left
# for an undetected *17 -- a homozygous *2/*2 call is complete regardless).
# Source: Pratt VM et al. 2010, J Mol Diagn 12:835-846 (PMID 20889555), as
# reproduced in CDC's public-domain data table
# (https://www.cdc.gov/lab-quality/media/pdfs/2024/08/CYP2C19_GeneConsensus.pdf,
# retrieved 2026-08-18). Genotype below constructed from this project's own
# dbSNP-confirmed defining-variant coordinates (genes/cyp2c19.py), not
# redistributed from GeT-RM/Coriell/CDC directly.
